The Special challenge in picoCTF 2023 is a General Skills task that places you in a restricted, spell-checking shell environment.  The shell automatically corrects misspelled commands and capitalizes the first letter of your input, preventing standard command execution. 

Challenge Overview
Author: LT 'syreal' Jones
Difficulty: Medium (300 points)
Goal: Retrieve the flag hidden in the filesystem despite the shell restrictions. 
